  "raw": "\nA TRICKY brain teaser has challenged puzzlers around the world to help find the dragon egg hidden under the cushion and the prize could be an exciting £50,000 A DAY for life.\nBored of ticking off tasks from Doctor Who or Game of Thrones? There is now the task of finding that hidden egg.\n1 The quicker you find the egg, the prize is £50,000 for life Credit: Bored Panda\nReady the prize could be a whopping £50,000 for life for whoever quickest finds it out and the task has been created to promote a new series of the BBC's show 'Counting down to the transfer window.'\nTeaming up with Bored Panda, the task has launched with a few different puzzles, each with a different challenge, aside from finding an egg.\nReady, set, GO - the task is all about the task itself.\nReady the prize could be half a million quid a year from the prize pool.\n",
